      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The numerator x^2 cos x has derivative 2x cos x - x^2 sin x, so the quotient rule gives f'(x) = ((2x cos x - x^2 sin x)sin x - x^2 cos x cos x)/sin^2 x.",
         "mathjson": [
